 "window": [
  "2011-12-01",
  "2026-09-30"
 ],
 "procedure": [
  "For each series, the ALFRED download form (/series/downloaddata?seid=<ID>) was posted from the browser on the user's computer with output 'Observations by Real-Time Period' (zipped CSV), observation range 2011-12-01..2026-09-30 and every vintage date on or after 2011-12-01, in requests of at most 450 vintages (ALFRED's limit for daily series).",
  "Each response's SHA-256 was computed in the browser; the zip was decompressed in the browser and the real-time periods were combined per observation.",
  "First vintage = earliest real-time start at which an observation has a value. Revisions = changes in value (or deletion) across later real-time periods.",
  "Latest table = 'YYYYMMDD,value' rows of the latest vintage, as served, joined by \\n. Its SHA-256 is compared with the same table built from each pinned file (native_backtest/scripts/ap3_mediator_inventory.py)."
 ],
